# Goal

Build the Comments module for project memories.

Comments allow workspace members to collaborate around a memory, discuss uploaded files, and maintain project context.

The feature should feel similar to comments in GitHub, Notion, Linear, or Jira.

---

# Scope

Build

- Comments list
- Comment item
- Add comment form
- Delete comment
- Loading state
- Empty state
- Error state

Integrate with the existing backend.

No mock data.

---

# User Experience

The experience should feel lightweight and collaborative.

Prioritize

- readability
- quick interaction
- minimal friction
- clear hierarchy

Comments should appear instantly after successful submission using React Query invalidation.

---

# Backend

Use the existing backend.

Use only the provided APIs.

Do not redesign backend endpoints.

Typical operations include

GET comments

POST comment

DELETE comment

Use TanStack Query.

