# Motion

Use Motion (motion.dev) for subtle, premium interactions.

Recommended

• Page fade

• Stagger comment appearance

• Comment fade-in

• Composer expand animation

• Delete animation

• Hover elevation

Animations should feel similar to

Linear

Notion

GitHub

Avoid decorative animations.

---

# Motion Primitives

Reuse Motion Primitives wherever possible.

Examples

FadeIn

SlideUp

StaggerContainer

AnimatedList

ScaleIn

Do not duplicate animation logic.

---

# React Bits

Use React Bits selectively.

Good candidates

• Empty comments illustration

• Loading skeleton

• Animated placeholder

• Micro interactions

Avoid flashy hero animations.

Keep the application enterprise-focused.

